Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/sam-rs
Description: Rust (candle) inference for Segment Anything models
 sam-rs segments images with SAM, MobileSAM, EfficientSAM, SAM 2 and SAM 3,
 locally via candle. Model weights are downloaded from Hugging Face on
 first use into ~/.cache/sam-rs.
